*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0013
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 380
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0013.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DPD-DAYS           PIC 9(3).
    *> STATEMENT AMOUNT DUE
    05 STMT-DUE-AMT       PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2000-LATE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
2000-LATE-PENALTY.
    *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 7.5 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF DPD-DAYS >= 1 AND <= 10
        MOVE 25 TO PENALTY-AMT
    ELSE
        IF DPD-DAYS >= 11 AND <= 45
            MOVE 50 TO PENALTY-AMT
        ELSE
            *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY - LIMIT 749 PER 1998 POLICY
            IF DPD-DAYS >= 46 AND <= 999
                COMPUTE PENALTY-AMT = STMT-DUE-AMT * 0.05
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO PENALTY-AMT
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
